# Keep the comparison repo clean: commit only source. Every app's dependencies and
# build artifacts are reproducible from its manifest, so they are ignored here.

# --- JS/TS (React, Vue, Svelte, Solid, Angular, ...) ---
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/.vite/
**/.angular/
**/.svelte-kit/
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/pnpm-lock.yaml
**/package-lock.json
**/yarn.lock
**/bun.lockb

# --- .NET (Blazor) ---
**/bin/
**/obj/

# --- Rust (Leptos/Yew, later passes) ---
**/target/
**/Cargo.lock

# --- GWC (Go → wasm) build output for this study ---
apps/gwc/dist/

# --- misc ---
**/.DS_Store
